      "hash": "fbf74f0e63896efe",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 7]"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_main_0470_nresercher_05_old",
      "hash": "161b4bb43a176cca",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 8]"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_main_0470_poke_02",
      "hash": "0cfbc97cbaa45b1b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 9]"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "id": "msg_main_0470_nresercher_01",
      "hash": "5941293e3724d390",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "助手：你来了啊！\\n那么，给你看个好东西哦！"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "id": "msg_main_0470_nresercher_08",
      "hash": "5941323e3724e2db",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "其实我终于\\n掌握了[VAR COLOR(0006)]秘术“炫光闪”[VAR COLOR(0000)]哦！"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "id": "msg_main_0470_nresercher_09",
      "hash": "5941313e3724e128",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "先把灯这么一关……"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "id": "msg_main_0470_nresercher_02",
      "hash": "59412c3e3724d8a9",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "好了，现在漆黑一片了。\\c\\n在此平静一下内心……\\c\\n用力地来一个深呼吸……\\n无论多黑的地方……\\c\\n我都能……\\n感受到周围的状况！"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "id": "msg_main_0470_nresercher_03",
      "hash": "59412b3e3724d6f6",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "你看！就算不开灯，\\n也能感受到光明吧！\\c\\n不但如此，我的集中力\\n还能影响到我周围的人！\\c\\n我把这个秘术\\n也教给[VAR TRNAME(0000)]你吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "id": "msg_main_0470_pikachu_01",
      "hash": "701a1e6d114892aa",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "丘～！"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "id": "msg_main_0470_eievui_01",
      "hash": "7322242f70db9f68",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "布伊～！"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "id": "msg_main_0470_nresercher_04",
      "hash": "59412e3e3724dc0f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "助手：……什么？你说你不学，\\n换你的[VAR POKNAME(0002)]来学吗？"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "id": "msg_main_0470_nresercher_10",
      "hash": "593dc43e3721f21a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "什么什么！？你说它\\n已经学会了秘术“袈裟斩”！？"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "id": "msg_main_0470_nresercher_11",
      "hash": "593dc53e3721f3cd",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "是嘛！\\n其实大木博士也这么说过，\\c\\n你的[VAR POKNAME(0002)]\\n似乎真的十分特别呢！"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "id": "msg_main_0470_nresercher_05",
      "hash": "59412d3e3724da5c",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "真是有趣！那我就教它试试吧！\\n那么我再关一次灯哦。"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "id": "msg_main_0470_nresercher_06",
      "hash": "5941303e3724df75",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "来吧，[VAR POKNAME(0002)]！\\n跟我一起来。\\c\\n平静一下内心……\\n用力地来一个深呼吸……\\c\\n用心去感受……\\n周围的状况！"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "id": "msg_main_0470_sys_01",
      "hash": "05efed7b7c713db0",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR PKNICK(0003)]学会了\\n[VAR COLOR(0006)]秘术“炫光闪”[VAR COLOR(0000)]！"
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "id": "msg_main_0470_nresercher_07",
      "hash": "59412f3e3724ddc2",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "助手：你的[VAR POKNAME(0002)]\\n简直太赞了！"
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "id": "msg_main_0470_nresercher_12",
      "hash": "593dc23e3721eeb4",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "助手：你要多多让它使用秘术哦！\\c\\n秘术并不算是招式，\\n所以即使是没力气战斗的时候\\r\\n也是使得出的哦！"
    }
  ],
